 "turns": [
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Hi! How are you doing these days?",
   "est_sec": 2.27,
   "gap_before": 0.68,
   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Kind of tired, honestly.",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 0.39,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_26"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I need a book for my dad. He's sixty, grumpy, and only reads about the war.",
   "est_sec": 5.06,
   "gap_before": 0.38,
   "block": "books.dlg16",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Sounds like a man of focus. Does he prefer big history books, or personal stories from soldiers?",
   "est_sec": 5.37,
   "gap_before": 0.31,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Personal stories, I think. He gets bored by maps and dates.",
   "est_sec": 3.51,
   "gap_before": 1.48,
   "block": "books.dlg16",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then a memoir or a collection of letters from soldiers could be perfect. They're very human and often moving.",
   "est_sec": 5.99,
   "gap_before": 1.18,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "He'll pretend he doesn't care, though.",
   "est_sec": 1.96,
   "gap_before": 1.29,
   "block": "books.dlg16",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "That's fine. Grumpy dads often read the whole thing in two days and then never mention it again.",
   "est_sec": 5.68,
   "gap_before": 0.85,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "books.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "That's",
   "est_sec": 0.41,
   "gap_before": 0.47,
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "pause",
   "block": "books.dlg16"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "honestly exactly what he'd do.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 1.7,
   "block": "books.dlg16",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Then it's a winner. Ask in a good bookshop for a well reviewed soldier memoir, they'll have favorites.",
